Error [jet.EffectBoundExceeded]: `caller` uses the effect `FS.Read("x")`, which its signature doesn't allow
  --> tests/ui/effects/named_callback_flows_through_to_caller.jet:5:16
    |
  5 | caller: fn() -[Net]> String { return apply(readit) }
    |                ^^^
 Why: The signature declares `-[Net]>`, so the body may only use those; `FS.Read("x")` is outside that set
 Fix: Add `FS.Read("x")` to the effect list, or stop using it in `caller`
 Denial: invocation
 Call chain: caller
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0740
